jei.immersivenuclear.chemical_processor.info=3x6x3 multiblock (45 blocks). Build the structure and hit the redstone engineering block (front side) with the Engineer's Hammer. Inputs: water on the right; uranium powder and reagent at the back; energy on the heavy engineering blocks. Slurry comes out on the left. A redstone signal stops the machine (the hammer inverts that).
