jei.immersivenuclear.cal.info=Neutralizes the chemical effluent in the IE Mixer (it becomes neutralized sludge). Recipe and use come with the Chemical Separation Unit.
jei.immersivenuclear.torta_neutralizacao.info=Solid left when the neutralized sludge is filtered. 4 cakes make 1 Impure Agglomerate.
jei.immersivenuclear.aglomerado_impuro.info=Heavy building block made of neutralization cake or mineral residue (4 of either).
jei.immersivenuclear.agente_precipitante.info=Goes into the Precipitation Unit (future machine) to turn the uranium into a solid.
jei.immersivenuclear.concentrado_umido_uranio.info=Comes out of the Precipitation Unit (future machine) and goes to the Industrial Dryer.
jei.immersivenuclear.yellowcake.info=Final product of line 1: uranium concentrate, not enriched. Comes out of the Industrial Dryer (future machine).
jei.immersivenuclear.fluid_futuro.info=Fluid of the next machines of the line (chemical separation, effluent treatment and drying). For now it can only be stored in tanks.